{"warnings":{"main":{"warnings":"Unrecognized parameter: pilicense."}},"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":10271,"ns":0,"title":"Mat Lucas","revisions":[{"revid":15762812,"parentid":15491029,"timestamp":"2026-10-18T20:01:08Z","slots":{"main":{"contentmodel":"wikitext","contentformat":"text/x-wiki","content":"{{Top|rwp}}\n{{Image|person}}\n'''Mat Lucas''' is a voice actor who voiced [[Anakin Skywalker/Legends|Anakin Skywalker]] in ''[[Star Wars: Clone Wars]]'' and a few ''Star Wars ''video games. He is considered an \"audio double\" of [[Hayden Christensen]]. He also has done editing and other film-related tasks at AFI. Mat has stated that he hopes to do more voice-overs in the future. Despite this, he would be replaced by [[Matt Lanter]], who voiced the character onward.\n\nMat Lucas was originally going to voice [[Anakin Skywalker/Legends|Anakin]] in the 2008 show [[Star Wars: The Clone Wars]] as well, and even recorded his lines for the first 6 episodes. However, he was later replaced by [[Matt Lanter]].<ref name=\"FSF Podcast\">{{YouTube|video=7PM2A1hkkTc|text=The 2D Anakin ft. Mat Lucas|channel=@fsfpopcast|name=The FSF PopCast|date=2024-01-05}}</ref>\n\n==Works==\n===Gameography===\n*''[[Star Wars: Galactic Battlegrounds: Clone Campaigns]]'' {{C|Anakin Skywalker}}\n*''[[Star Wars Episode III: Revenge of the Sith (video game)|Star Wars Episode III: Revenge of the Sith]]'' video game {{C|Anakin Skywalker}}\n*''[[Star Wars: Battlefront II]]'' {{C|Anakin Skywalker}}\n*''[[Star Wars: The Clone Wars (video game)|Star Wars: The Clone Wars]]'' video game {{C|Anakin Skywalker}}\n*''[[Star Wars: The Force Unleashed]]'' (PSP, PS2 and Wii version only) <small>(Anakin Skywalker)</small>\n\n===Filmography===\n*''[[Star Wars: Clone Wars]]'' {{C|Anakin Skywalker}}\n**{{CW|2}} {{C|Anakin Skywalker}}\n**{{CW|10}} {{C|Anakin Skywalker}}\n**{{CW|11}} {{C|Anakin Skywalker}}\n**{{CW|17}} {{C|Anakin Skywalker}}\n**{{CW|19}} {{C|Anakin Skywalker}}\n**{{CW|20}} {{C|Anakin Skywalker}}\n**{{CW|21}} {{C|Anakin Skywalker}}\n**{{CW|22}} {{C|Anakin Skywalker}}\n**{{CW|23}} {{C|Anakin Skywalker}}\n**{{CW|24}} {{C|Anakin Skywalker}}\n**{{CW|25}} {{C|Anakin Skywalker}}\n\n\n==Notes and references==\n{{Mediacat|soundcat=Audio files of Mat Lucas}}\n{{Reflist}}\n\n==External links==\n*{{Facebook|username=mat.lucas.79|name=Mat Lucas}}\n*{{LinkedIn|url=in/mat-lucas-6636755|text=Mat Lucas}}\n*{{WP|Mat Lucas}}\n*{{IMDb|name/nm1103468}}\n*{{YouTube|video=7PM2A1hkkTc|text=The 2D Anakin ft. Mat Lucas|channel=@fsfpopcast|name=The FSF PopCast}}\n\n{{Interlang\n|es=Mat Lucas\n}}\n\n[[Category:Actors who have portrayed Anakin Skywalker]]\n[[Category:Star Wars Episode III: Revenge of the Sith video game voice actors]]\n[[Category:Star Wars: Battlefront II voice actors]]\n[[Category:Star Wars: Clone Wars voice actors]]\n[[Category:Star Wars: The Clone Wars video game voice actors]]"}}}],"images":[{"ns":6,"title":"File:Bobawhere.jpg"},{"ns":6,"title":"File:CloneWarsLogoMini.jpg"},{"ns":6,"title":"File:Facebook icon.svg"},{"ns":6,"title":"File:IMDb.svg"},{"ns":6,"title":"File:LinkedIn-Logo.svg"},{"ns":6,"title":"File:Premium-Era-real.png"},{"ns":6,"title":"File:Wiki-shrinkable.png"},{"ns":6,"title":"File:Wikipedia-Logo.svg"},{"ns":6,"title":"File:YouTube.svg"}],"pageprops":{"defaultsort":"Lucas, Mat","displaytitle":"Mat Lucas","fandomdescription":"Mat Lucas is a voice actor who voiced Anakin Skywalker in Star Wars: Clone Wars and a few Star Wars video games. He is considered an \"audio double\" of Hayden Christensen. He also has done editing and other film-related tasks at AFI. Mat has stated that he hopes to do more voice-overs in the future. Despite this, he would be replaced by Matt Lanter, who voiced the character onward. Mat Lucas was originally going to voice Anakin in the 2008 show Star Wars: The Clone Wars as well, and even recorded his lines for the first 6..."}}]}}